# Test type bags discovered through their manifests in META-INF/ki/bags (TypeBagsTest).
# The missing manifest, the clash, the missing requirement, the throwing getter and the stale manifest are
# deliberate: each must be skipped and reported in TypeBags.problems without hiding DiscoveredBag.
# The lazy bags are created only when something refers to them; PreloadedBag at discovery.
